---
import { NAV, SITE } from '../consts';

const thisYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-pine-50/40">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 sm:py-18">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-8">
			<!-- Column 1 (4/12): Brand + address -->
			<div class="sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-4">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
					<span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-pine-900 text-white shadow-soft" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="h-6 w-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
							<path d="M12 3c-1.5 2.5-3 4-5 4a5 5 0 0 0-2 9.5A5 5 0 0 0 10 20h4a5 5 0 0 0 5-3.5A5 5 0 0 0 17 7c-2 0-3.5-1.5-5-4Z" />
							<path d="M12 21v-8" />
							<path d="M7 13h3" />
							<path d="M14 13h3" />
						</svg>
					</span>
					<div class="flex flex-col leading-tight">
						<span class="text-lg font-bold text-pine-950">Burnham Park · Baguio</span>
						<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pine-700 font-semibold">Opisyal na Gabay sa Bisita</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-lg">
					Ang 32.84-ektaryang parke sa puso ng Lungsod ng Baguio. Itinayo noong 1907 ayon sa plano ni
					Daniel Burnham — ngayon ay pinamamahalaan ng Lungsod ng Baguio.
				</p>

				<address class="not-italic text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed bg-white/70 border border-slate-100 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-soft">
					<p class="font-semibold text-pine-900 mb-1">Tiyak na Lokasyon</p>
					<p>{SITE.address}</p>
					<p class="text-slate-600">Plus Code: {SITE.plusCode}</p>
					<p class="text-slate-600">
						Koordinata: {SITE.coordinates.lat.toFixed(5)}°N, {SITE.coordinates.lng.toFixed(5)}°E
					</p>
				</address>
			</div>

			<!-- Column 2 (2/12): Main Navigation -->
			<div class="sm:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2">
				<h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pine-800 mb-4">
					Mga Pahina
				</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
					{
						NAV.slice(0, 4).map((item) => (
							<li>
								<a
									href={item.href}
									class="inline-flex w-full rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-slate-700 hover:bg-pine-50 hover:text-pine-800 transition-colors"
								>
									{item.label}
								</a>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Column 3 (2/12): More pages -->
			<div class="sm:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2">
				<h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pine-800 mb-4">
					Higit Pa
				</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
					{
						NAV.slice(4).map((item) => (
							<li>
								<a
									href={item.href}
									class="inline-flex w-full rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-slate-700 hover:bg-pine-50 hover:text-pine-800 transition-colors"
								>
									{item.label}
								</a>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Column 4 (4/12): Quick facts + disclaimer -->
			<div class="sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-4">
				<h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pine-800 mb-4">
					Mabilis na Paalala
				</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700 mb-6">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pine-500"></span>WALANG BAYAD ang pagpasok.</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pine-500"></span>Bukas 24 oras ang parke.</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pine-500"></span>Pinakamaganda 6–10 ng umaga.</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="mt-1 inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pine-500"></span>Malamig, magdala ng jacket.</li>
				</ul>

				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-sand-200 bg-rose-sand-50/80 p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
					<p class="font-semibold text-rose-sand-700 mb-1">Paunawa</p>
					Ang site na ito ay <strong>hindi opisyal</strong> at walang kaakibat na pamahalaang lungsod ng Baguio o Kagawaran ng Turismo ng Pilipinas.
					Maaaring magbago ang mga presyo, oras, at tuntunin — laging suriin ang pinakabagong palatandaan sa lugar bago pumunta.
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-14 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-600">
			<p>&copy; {thisYear} Burnham Park Baguio Editorial. Lahat ng gabay ay inihanda nang may pag-iingat.</p>
			<p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
				<span class="inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-pine-500"></span>
				Binuo sa Baguio · Cordillera Administrative Region, Pilipinas
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
